URL autolinking also works: https://github.com/trail-b1az3r/mdxl

> [!TIP]
> Use callouts for a tip that should stand apart from the surrounding paragraph.

#### Markdown Extra

MDXL supports a footnote reference[^note].

[^note]: This footnote is collected below the document.

MDXL
: Markdown plus expressive syntax.

*[MDXL]: Markdown Extended Logic

MDXL keeps its source human-readable.

## Custom heading IDs {#anchors}

You can link to [this section](#anchors) through the custom heading ID.

??? note "A collapsible note"

    This extended Markdown block can be opened when the reader wants more detail.

Five-backtick code blocks are copyable, and code does not execute automatically:

`````python
print("The renderer displays code; it never executes it.")
```
